  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is responding to the earthquake that struck Myanmar. WV Myanmar are delivering a response in the following focus areas:
 
 Food security; multi-purpose cash assistance; WASH; Hygiene kits and NFIs; and Child protection. This is based on a Sitrep that was shared today (2/4/25). A plan is to follow shortly as the NO will start working on this.</narrative>
  </description>
